  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Tie Dao Ku opens his Shang clan city battle stage fight with Bai Ning Bing by activating Iron Hand Gu and Hand Blade Gu together.",
        "chapters": [
          298
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_tie_dao_ku",
          "loc_shang_clan_city",
          "char_bai_ning_bing",
          "gu_iron_hand_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "In the Bai Ning Bing match he stacks the Gu with Swift Shadow Gu for speed, then keeps pressing with hand blades until Bai Ning Bing breaks his momentum at range and later blinds his left eye with Ice Explosion Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          298
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "lost-and-replaced",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_swift_shadow_gu",
          "gu_ice_explosion_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "After that fight Bai Ning Bing takes his Hand Blade Gu, and with the lost eye and lost Gu he is no longer her match. He had to buy a Hand Blade Gu in Shang clan city, and that cost left him unable to save the hundred thousand primeval stones needed for Doctor Su Shou’s eye treatment.",
        "chapters": [
          302
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "lost-and-replaced",
